[5.03,"o","  \u001b[33mwarning\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mcapability/unconstrained-file-write\u001b[0m  Parameter \"path\" takes any path for a write operation. Add a pattern that confines it to an allowed root.\r\n"]
[5.09,"o","  \u001b[34minfo   \u001b[0m  \u001b[2mcapability/missing-annotations     \u001b[0m  Tool name suggests it changes state. Set annotations.destructiveHint (or readOnlyHint) so clients can ask before running it.\r\n"]
